# fake_moonraker
# An HTLF (configs/htlf.cfg: drive and selector steppers, a lobed cam homed to
# its home switch, AFC_lane lanes): PREP (each lane's test homes the cam
# first and after), AFC_HOME_UNIT, lane moves through the drive stepper
# (each selecting its lane: home the cam, turn it to the lane's lobe)
CONFIG ../configs/htlf.cfg
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict Turtle_1=stm32h723.dict

G4 P1000
PREP
AFC_STATUS
AFC_HOME_UNIT UNIT=HTLF_1
LANE_MOVE LANE=lane3 DISTANCE=50
LANE_MOVE LANE=lane1 DISTANCE=-20
LANE_MOVE LANE=lane1 DISTANCE=20
AFC_STATUS
